flowchart LR
    Dataset[11 synthetic M12 scenarios]

    subgraph Splits[Versioned dataset splits]
        PlanningSplit[planning]
        VerificationSplit[evidence-verification]
        FitSplit[research-fit]
        WorkflowSplit[graph-fake]
        LiveSplit[graph-live]
    end

    Dataset --> PlanningSplit
    Dataset --> VerificationSplit
    Dataset --> FitSplit
    Dataset --> WorkflowSplit
    Dataset --> LiveSplit

    subgraph Targets[Typed target functions]
        PlanningTarget[Search planning target]
        VerificationTarget[Evidence verification target]
        FitTarget[Research Fit target]
        FakeTarget[Fake end-to-end graph target]
        LiveGate{Explicit live end-to-end opt-in?}
        LiveTarget[Live end-to-end graph target]
    end

    PlanningSplit --> PlanningTarget
    VerificationSplit --> VerificationTarget
    FitSplit --> FitTarget
    WorkflowSplit --> FakeTarget
    LiveSplit --> LiveGate
    LiveGate -->|yes and credentials present| LiveTarget
    LiveGate -->|no| SkipLive[Skip without provider construction]

    subgraph Exact[Deterministic evaluators]
        Schema[Schema and terminology]
        Evidence[Evidence IDs and source URLs]
        Score[Score bounds and component totals]
        Safety[Availability and admission safety]
        Route[Fallback and duplicate rate]
        Approval[Candidate approval enforcement]
    end

    PlanningTarget --> Schema
    VerificationTarget --> Schema
    VerificationTarget --> Evidence
    VerificationTarget --> Safety
    FitTarget --> Schema
    FitTarget --> Evidence
    FitTarget --> Score
    FitTarget --> Safety
    FakeTarget --> Exact
    LiveTarget --> Exact

    subgraph Qualitative[Optional structured-output judges]
        JudgeGate{Explicit judge opt-in?}
        Relevance[Research Fit relevance]
        Explanation[Explanation usefulness]
        Grounding[Evidence-grounded rationale]
        Shortlist[Shortlist usefulness]
    end

    FitTarget --> JudgeGate
    FakeTarget --> JudgeGate
    LiveTarget --> JudgeGate
    JudgeGate -->|yes and model key present| Relevance
    JudgeGate -->|yes and model key present| Explanation
    JudgeGate -->|yes and model key present| Grounding
    JudgeGate -->|yes and model key present| Shortlist
    JudgeGate -->|no| SkipJudge[Record judge metrics as not run]

    Exact --> Local[Direct offline baseline; no LangSmith client]
    Qualitative --> LiveExperiment[Opt-in LangSmith experiment]
    LiveTarget --> LiveExperiment

    Local --> Baseline[Transparent baseline record]
    LiveExperiment --> Dashboard[Versioned LangSmith results]

    Privacy[Metadata allowlist only]
    Privacy -. excludes Candidate content, queries, URLs, pages, and secrets .-> Targets
    Privacy -. fixed application, version, provider, fallback, and review tags .-> Dashboard
